  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn. In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook half the garlic and corn until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add white rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-434afeae.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-01558719.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based mince and onion, breaking up mince with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-6ba41e66.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add All-American spice blend and remaining garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove pan from heat then stir in sweet & savoury glaze and a splash of water, until combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-4306e3c3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While mince is cooking, in a large bowl, combine slaw mix, baby spinach leaves, plant-based aioli and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-d032774c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice between bowls. Top with smokey Southern-style plant-based mince and creamy slaw.\n• Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9abc74113630c74a33f7c-6a30c7bb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
